0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1vtolr2:"><div data-rid="840bee7a-333b-4c5c-a142-7db09d22e958" class="r-73ubmc"><div data-rid="35e635f9-7294-46b2-9142-35a576847a23" class="r-lawygw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>A woman's body relies on micronutrients to manage cramps, energize muscles, and regulate inflammation. But monthly blood loss, combined with fast-paced living or less-than-ideal nutrition, can leave reserves depleted. <strong>A 2024 study led by Harvard researchers found that many UK women have at least five major micronutrient gaps.*</strong></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="23f2eb08-1cea-4444-ac83-805a71449400" class="r-19hpdi9" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="55baf010-2fb9-49a5-a343-725c10da30cd" aria-controls="replo-:R2vtolr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1fu24ez"><div data-rid="8b26da02-288f-4da7-b3c5-1d6c624a9972" class="r-1gq47c2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How monthlies helps</p></span></div><div data-rid="31250dd1-bffe-4992-9a53-09be2f81bfd1" class="r-c6ih0k"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1wdcjyj" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2vtolr2:"><div data-rid="cf05ac07-2659-494d-ac4d-b260a015201c" class="r-15ecjxz"><div data-rid="b9397a66-9cb4-48ea-b0f5-220feb3fdcdb" class="r-1n8sxx6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Packed with 26 scientifically backed ingredients, monthlies is the UK's most comprehensive formula for women’s health —all in a once-daily drink.<br><br>By<strong> </strong>replenishing<strong> </strong>essential micronutrients like<strong> Magnesium, Zinc, Iron, the entire Vitamin B Complex, and Vitamins D3 + K2, </strong>monthlies helps strengthen muscle function, energy production, and hormonal balance.*<br><br>This results in <strong>better control over cramps, calmer inflammation, hormonal regularion, clearer skin, fewer mood swings, and overall more optimal, more comfortable cycles.*</strong></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5f942502-42fc-46d2-ab55-81a76b405fd7" class="r-87195c" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="f5df5ef2-1371-43d1-8089-25992edfc630" aria-controls="replo-:R3vtolr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-xb2ran"><div data-rid="6ce47b64-b2ba-44b3-9877-783a8a6a05fc" class="r-1510ju0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Clinical study highlight</p></span></div><div data-rid="a0fd2756-6dc2-4234-ba37-4d6fcd2847e5" class="r-n9kykb"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-rcfpg9" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3vtolr2:"><div data-rid="76252b21-cad2-437c-aad2-4228745f3e0e" class="r-17f2v1m"><div data-rid="f61db69c-ba6c-4a7a-ae8e-00ea9e695b3a" class="r-1wy8bfw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Calcium (found in monthlies): A systematic review of 14 studies (8 interventional, 6 observational) found that women with PMS have lower serum calcium levels and that calcium supplementation significantly reduces both the incidence and severity of PMS symptoms, underscoring a protective role for calcium in PMS management. In a randomised crossover trial of calcium carbonate, 73% of women had fewer symptoms after 3 months. Calcium eased low mood, bloating, and pain before menstruation, and also reduc